  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilience WASH, Food Security and Economic Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to empower existing community structures to take over the management of key community affairs, including WASH (Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene) services, food security, economic development, and peacebuilding, in the face of weak or absent duty bearers due to the ongoing conflict. The goal is to ensure the sustainable management of WASH services and maximize opportunities for food security and economic development, following a multisectoral, community-driven approach.</narrative>
  </description>
